<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
    Run-scoped, in-memory <code>CredentialsProvider</code>: resolves credentials
    only for the Pipeline build currently executing, and only what that build
    itself cached. Nothing it holds is ever written to disk.<br/>
    A set of pipeline global variables (steps) accompany this plugin to ask
    for any missing credentials interactively as the build runs.
</div>
